## File Dependency Graph

```
simulator_api.py (FastAPI + Socket.IO web layer)
  └── simulator_core.py (indicators, strategies, SimulationManager)
        ├── synthetic_market_simulator.py (Phase 1: GBM, regime, jumps, spread, fees, leverage)
        └── synthetic_market_simulator_v2.py (Phase 2: GARCH, volume, slippage, correlation, cascade)
              └── synthetic_market_simulator.py (imports Phase 1 classes)

synthetic_market_simulator_v3.py (Phase 3: agents, liquidity, adversarial — standalone/research only)
  ├── synthetic_market_simulator.py
  └── synthetic_market_simulator_v2.py

auth-server/src/index.js (Express entry)
  ├── db.js (PostgreSQL pool + migration)
  ├── routes/auth.js (login, register, Google OAuth, verify)
  │     └── middleware/auth.js (JWT sign/verify/requireAuth)
  └── routes/portfolio.js (balance, trade sync)

auth-client/src/main.jsx → App.jsx
  ├── components/LoginForm.jsx
  ├── components/RegisterForm.jsx
  ├── components/GoogleButton.jsx
  ├── components/Dashboard.jsx
  └── components/SimulatorPage.jsx (+ SimulatorPage.css)
```

