## Key Constants

| Constant | Value | Location |
|----------|-------|----------|
| Initial Balance | $10,000 | simulator_core.py |
| Taker Fee | 0.06% | simulator_core.py |
| Maker Fee | 0.02% | simulator_core.py |
| Maintenance Margin | 0.5% | simulator_core.py |
| Tick Rate | 50ms (20 FPS) | simulator_core.py |
| Max Candles Stored | 2,000 | simulator_core.py |
| JWT Expiry | 7 days | middleware/auth.js |
| bcrypt Rounds | 12 | routes/auth.js |
| GARCH α₀/α₁/β | 1e-6 / 0.10 / 0.85 | v2.py Phase2Config |
| Cascade Threshold | -5% return | v2.py Phase2Config |
| EBB Max Drawdown | 10% | simulator_core.py |
| EBB ADX Filter | > 22 | simulator_core.py |
| EBB Risk Per Trade | 1% | simulator_core.py |
